<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fișă Medicală - <%= user.firstName %> <%= user.lastName %></title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #007AFF;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #007AFF;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        .patient-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background-color: #F8F9FA;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .info-group {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .info-value {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #2C2C2E;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5EA;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        th, td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5EA;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #F2F2F7;
            color: #3A3A3C;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .status-normal { color: #34C759; font-weight: bold; }
        .status-high { color: #FF3B30; font-weight: bold; }
        .status-low { color: #FF9500; font-weight: bold; }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8E8E93;
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #E5E5EA;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>Raport Medical: Istoric Analize</h1>
        <p>Generat la: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('ro-RO') %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="patient-info">
        <div class="info-group">
            <div class="info-label">Pacient</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.firstName %> <%= user.lastName %></div>
            <div class="info-label" style="margin-top: 10px;">Email</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.email %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-group">
            <div class="info-label">Data Nașterii</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.dateOfBirth ? new Date(user.dateOfBirth).toLocaleDateString('ro-RO') : 'Nespecificat' %></div>
            <div class="info-label" style="margin-top: 10px;">Gen</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.gender || 'Nespecificat' %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-group">
            <div class="info-label">Greutate</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.weight ? user.weight + ' kg' : 'Nespecificat' %></div>
            <div class="info-label" style="margin-top: 10px;">Înălțime</div>
            <div class="info-value"><%= user.height ? user.height + ' cm' : 'Nespecificat' %></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Sumar Sănătate</h2>
    <p><strong>Scor evaluat:</strong> <%= score %>/100</p>
    <p>Din totalul analizelor efectuate pe plan global, pacientul prezintă <% if (metrics.warning > 0) { %> <%= metrics.warning %> valori în afara limitelor <% } else { %> toți parametrii în limite normale <% } %>.</p>

    <h2>Istoric Rezultate</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Data</th>
                <th>Analiză</th>
                <th>Rezultat</th>
                <th>Interval Referință</th>
                <th>Status</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <% results.forEach(function(r) { %>
                <tr>
                    <td><%= new Date(r.date).toLocaleDateString('ro-RO') %></td>
                    <td><%= r.analysisType.name %></td>
                    <td>
                        <strong><%= r.value !== null ? r.value : r.stringValue %></strong>
                        <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;"><%= r.analysisType.unit || '' %></span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
                            <%= r.analysisType.refMin ? r.analysisType.refMin : '' %> 
                            <%= (r.analysisType.refMin && r.analysisType.refMax) ? '-' : '' %> 
                            <%= r.analysisType.refMax ? r.analysisType.refMax : '' %>
                        </span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <% if (r.status === 'normal') { %>
                            <span class="status-normal">Normal</span>
                        <% } else if (r.status === 'high') { %>
                            <span class="status-high">Ridicat</span>
                        <% } else if (r.status === 'low') { %>
                            <span class="status-low">Scăzut</span>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <span>-</span>
                        <% } %>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            <% }); %>
            <% if (results.length === 0) { %>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="5" style="text-align: center;">Nu există analize înregistrate.</td>
                </tr>
            <% } %>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Acest raport a fost generat automat din aplicația "Jurnal Medical". Vă rugăm să prezentați aceste rezultate unui medic specialist pentru o interpretare aprofundată.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>